cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Environmental Digital Twin
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Calvin Stefan
    family-names: Iost
    affiliation: "Escola Politécnica da Universidade de São Paulo (USP)"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0828-6042"
repository-code: "https://github.com/calvinsiost/ecbyts_open"
url: "https://www.ecbt.ai"
abstract: >-
  Curated subset of the Equinor Volve field dataset prepared for
  environmental and occupational digital-twin integrity analysis.
  Includes environmental and petrophysical records, production data,
  and baseline marine survey data used to demonstrate the ECBT
  framework for auditable environmental records, blockchain anchoring,
  and non-compensatory integrity scoring with metrological uncertainty
  propagation.
keywords:
  - digital-twin
  - environmental-monitoring
  - volve-field
  - offshore
  - environmental-liabilities
  - integrity-score
  - blockchain
  - metrological-uncertainty
  - petrophysics
  - marine-baseline
